    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97118" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρᾰτήγ-ιον</span></b>  (in codd. sts. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εῖον</span>, as <i><span class="en">
